Fachzeitschrift: Neue Erkenntnisse zur Legasthenie-Früherkennung","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"c1-23-goethe-mini-3","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, dein überarbeiteter Absatz liest sich jetzt richtig dicht und präzise.","speaker":"Nadine","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_023_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-23-goethe-mini-3","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Danke, ich habe versucht, die Nominalgruppen konsequent zu verdichten.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_023_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-23-goethe-mini-3","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Man merkt es — der Vergleich am Ende wirkt jetzt viel überzeugender.","speaker":"Nadine","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_023_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-23-goethe-mini-3","level":"C1"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Gut, dann können wir den Artikel morgen einreichen.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_023_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c1-23-goethe-mini-3","level":"C1"},{"chapter":"c1-23-goethe-mini-3","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, dein überarbeiteter Absatz liest sich jetzt richtig dicht und präzise.","speaker":"Nadine","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C1_023_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-23-goethe-mini-3","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Danke, ich habe versucht, die Nominalgruppen konsequent zu verdichten.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C1_023_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c1-23-goethe-mini-3","level":"C1","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx"